--- forms ---
THREAD <tid>
OWN <hex>
WAIT <hex>
.

Each thread block ends with a lone closer line ".". OWN names the monitor the thread holds. WAIT names the monitor it is blocked on. Identity for emit is column two of /app/inkurn/book.tsv.

